          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! The \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 4.</para>
            <para>The correct answer is is 4. The \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 4.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
